<title>USA: Mass. awaits Middlesex County financial plan.</title>
<headline>Mass. awaits Middlesex County financial plan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Massachusetts official on Friday said that the state was waiting to hear whether Middlesex County, which is at risk of default, had produced a detailed financial plan by 1500 EST/2000 GMT, as requested by a state emergency board.</p>
<p>&quot;We haven't heard anything yet,&quot; said a spokesman for the state Treasurer's office.</p>
</text>
